# The second reading of a source, for the lookup rows.
#
# Every bound the lookup rules declare is recomputed here from Haböck's Lemma 5
# over exact fractions, by arithmetic this file's script owns, and compared
# against the judgments the derivation actually produced. Two implementations
# of one reading can share a misreading; a second reading of the source cannot
# be talked into one. `soundcalc.test` does the same for the FRI rows, and its
# history — a rate-convention misreading that understated a bound by up to
# 2.8x — is why both exist.
#
# What it independently derives rather than transcribes: that the cleared
# identity's degree is one less than the sum of the two column lengths, that
# the honest prover's failure set is a set of poles and therefore one larger,
# and that the characteristic hypothesis binds the larger of the two sides
# because the unequal case reduces to the lemma's equal-length statement by
# padding the shorter one.
#
# RUN: rm -rf %t && mkdir -p %t
# RUN: zkc-seal %S/../Encoding/logup-range-check.mlir %zkc-seal-full -o %t/rc.artifacts > /dev/null
# RUN: %python %S/../SemanticClosure/lib/artifact_handoff.py stage %t/rc.artifacts %t/rc.mlirbc
# RUN: %python %S/../Evidence/Inputs/retarget_request.py %S/Inputs/logup-range-check-request.json %t/rc.artifacts %t/rc.req.json
# RUN: zkc-derive --signature=%zkc-registry-dir/soundness-signature.json \
# RUN:   --protocol-vocabulary=%zkc-registry-dir/protocol-vocabulary.json \
# RUN:   --construction-profile-registry=%zkc-registry-dir/construction-profiles.json \
# RUN:   --request=%t/rc.req.json -o=%t/rc.out.json %t/rc.mlirbc
# RUN: %python %S/../Evidence/Inputs/retarget_request.py %S/Inputs/logup-range-check-completeness-request.json %t/rc.artifacts %t/rc.comp.req.json
# RUN: zkc-derive --signature=%zkc-registry-dir/soundness-signature.json \
# RUN:   --protocol-vocabulary=%zkc-registry-dir/protocol-vocabulary.json \
# RUN:   --construction-profile-registry=%zkc-registry-dir/construction-profiles.json \
# RUN:   --request=%t/rc.comp.req.json -o=%t/rc.comp.json %t/rc.mlirbc
# RUN: zkc-seal %S/../Encoding/logup-bus.mlir %zkc-seal-full -o %t/bus.artifacts > /dev/null
# RUN: %python %S/../SemanticClosure/lib/artifact_handoff.py stage %t/bus.artifacts %t/bus.mlirbc
# RUN: %python %S/../Evidence/Inputs/retarget_request.py %S/Inputs/logup-bus-request.json %t/bus.artifacts %t/bus.req.json
# RUN: zkc-derive --signature=%zkc-registry-dir/soundness-signature.json \
# RUN:   --protocol-vocabulary=%zkc-registry-dir/protocol-vocabulary.json \
# RUN:   --construction-profile-registry=%zkc-registry-dir/construction-profiles.json \
# RUN:   --request=%t/bus.req.json -o=%t/bus.out.json %t/bus.mlirbc
#
